      "text": "the Lamb will manifest himself to Gentiles to take away their stumbling blocks, 1 Ne. 14:1. wilt thou not place stumbling block in my way, 2 Ne. 4:33. he shall be for stone of stumbling to both houses of Israel, 2 Ne. 18:14 (Isa. 8:14). Gentiles have stumbled because of greatness of stumbling block, 2 Ne. 26:20. doings of the Lord’s people shall be as stumbling block, Mosiah 7:29. wickedness of Church is stumbling-block to those who do not belong to Church, Alma 4:10.",
